  "prompt_text": "Continue the text below with exactly one short, natural, coherent English sentence. Return only the continuation, with no preamble or explanation:\nDuring your entire life, you've been told you're deadly allergic to bees. You've always had people protecting you from them, be it your mother or a hired hand. Today, one slips through and lands on your shoulder. You hear a tiny voice say \"Your Majesty, what are your orders?\" I am scared to death but managed to calm down finally. I say \"I will have you removed from my shoulder and placed in a nice jar.\" The bee says \"Your Majesty, I will do that but I must tell you that I am not a bee, I am a tiny fairy.\" I say \"A fairy?\" \"Yes, I am a fairy and I will grant you three wishes.\" I say \"I wish to be the most beautiful woman in the world.\" The fairy says \"Your wish is granted.\" I look at the mirror and can't believe what I see! I see a very charming and beautiful woman in the mirror. \"Is it me?\" I ask the fairy. The fairy says it is. I say \"I wish to be rich.\" The fairy says \"Your wish is granted.\" I check my bank balance online which shows $10 millions! I am greedy and say \"I wish to have a big house.\" The fairy says \"Your wish is granted.\" A very big and luxurious house appears in front of me and a key lands on my hand! Suddenly I feel stung.",
